        "content": "## ⚠️ 3. Save to Google Sheets\n\nConnect your OWN Google Sheets credential and select your spreadsheet and tab. Create your tab with headers matching the 15 columns in this node.\n\nDon't click ⋮ → Refresh — it erases the column mapping."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
